    "editorialParagraph1": "Modern enterprise systems demand architectures that tolerate individual zone or regional service degradations without compromising user experience. We architect multi-tier cloud environments that isolate blast radiuses, decouple stateful persistence from stateless execution, and route traffic dynamically based on real-time health checks.",
    "editorialParagraph2": "By establishing dedicated transit hubs, centralized egress inspection points, and strict private endpoints, we eliminate public IP exposure from core microservices. Security policies, route tables, and resource configurations are versioned entirely as code, enabling repeatable reconstitution.",
