    "editorialParagraph1": "Our CI/CD engineering practice treats delivery pipelines as mission-critical production software. We eliminate the frustration of sluggish, fragile build runs by introducing parallelized test matrices, remote Docker build caches, and self-hosted elastic runner fleets that scale on demand.",
